PROVENANCE "Hand-written from SwipeDecisionTest.kt expectations. Not generated."

EXAMPLES rating
  id                      | swipeBelowThreshold | swipeYDominates | swipeDxPositive -> expected
  right-above-threshold   | false               | false           | true            -> good
  left-above-threshold    | false               | false           | false           -> again
  below-threshold-returns | true                | false           | true            -> none
  vertical-dominates      | false               | true            | true            -> none
  both-below-and-vertical | true                | true            | false           -> none
END
